      "content": "wow, really? you're sure it's fine? my doctor seemed really insistent that mixing them is a huge risk for stomach bleeding. if i take the extra one like you suggested, like maybe even two or three if it's really bad, am i going to be okay? i just don't want to end up in the hospital, i'm just so tired of the pain.",
